      "body": "Prepared new request `2026-09-10-four-slot-rolling-refill-01` for the same `portfolio:cross_direction` node.\r\n\r\nThe fixed [TASK](https://github.com/CartmanFatass/My-paper-code/blob/0a49fcc5659723e260f4d64d9892d25d3234b16c/docs/research/portfolio/pro_packets/20260910_four_slot_rolling_refill/TASK.md) asks for up to four independent rolling replacements alongside the active FSD design, preserving its MGTAP-only fallback. Recommendation A compares UCOPE L/F (3300 s), RCLE nearest-prior (300 s), one zero-numerical FOLR Convergence question and one ACVC fresh fit (360 s); B substitutes the explicitly conditional VSP03 60 s opportunity. These are pending proposals, not local Portfolio decisions or released budgets.\r\n\r\nAuthor preparation has zero scientific/model/test/provider-Send exposure. Root dispatches the bound HANDOFF once to the existing Transport task. This is a new question, not a resend of the completed fifth-vacancy request.\r\n\r\nThe scoped response is `docs/research/portfolio/pro_packets/20260910_four_slot_rolling_refill/archive/RESPONSE.md` on current descendant `codex/portfolio` HEAD. Preserve earlier requests, responses and all unrelated paths.\r\n",
